flowchart LR
  I[输入<br/>portraits/*.json<br/>内容观测 Excel] --> S[SemanticLoader<br/>value_anchors → Kernel PCA<br/>content_topics → 兴趣匹配]
  I --> P[PopulationSynthesizer<br/>Rogers 前16% 种子扩量<br/>精英保留 + Zipf 影响力]
  I --> M[StoryManager<br/>代表性内容筛选<br/>传播量归一化]
  S --> A[Vectorized ABM Engine<br/>score = w_i·interest + w_pop·pop<br/>+ w_time·time + w_rand·random]
  P --> A
  M --> A
  A --> C[机制约束<br/>Per-Batch Min-Max<br/>指数时间衰减<br/>TIER_WEIGHT + Soft Backfire]
  C --> E[EMCalibrationEngine<br/>E步：每条内容 p_base<br/>M步：Dirichlet 权重 + decay_lambda]
  E -.迭代仿真.-> A
  E --> Y[输出 calibration_profile.yaml<br/>推荐权重 / 衰减系数<br/>fit_diagnostics]
